<p><a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ef0a0312-ca1c-49f4-868b-5e6f8a8f5c73_2026+CAES+Housing+Info+Sheet.pdf">View Info Sheet for a full listing of services and operating hours</a><br>(Updated January 21, 2026)</p>
</div>
